@EdzestervGenerator.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5013

### List users
GET {{EdzestervGenerator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users

### Get one user
GET {{EdzestervGenerator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1

### Create a user
POST {{EdzestervGenerator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teszt Elek",
  "email": "teszt.elek@example.com"
}

### Update a user
PUT {{EdzestervGenerator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teszt Elek",
  "email": "elek@example.com"
}
